  "evidence": [
    "Pinned 0x5CE6E3 accesses state 0x694E14/18/1C/20 and adjustment table 0x694DF4 directly; current source aliases point into existing mapped MediaAdpcmTables.",
    "Both 0x5CE640 and 0x5CE6E3 are current mismatches and use adjustment values; preserve nibble selection, signed clamping, packed state and individual reload/write order. Original pushal/popal is not permission for inline assembly or exactness claims.",
    "The mapped 0x693794..0x694E24 storage is an observed window, not original aggregate/allocation proof. Do not widen or reinterpret storage, fix malformed inputs, change signatures, or edit movie conversion tables.",
    "Use actual-body host controls and negative mutants, preserve historical mappings and known state/caller behavior. Coordinator runs native storage control under lease plus full owner measurements and fresh build/link."
  ],
  "intent": "Recover direct existing ADPCM state/table member access in two decoders, removing artificial scalar/table pointer aliases without changing arithmetic, input domains or state order.",
